製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"7項企業看重的技能（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20230725/760564580358426624158642.png/OL54ces6IllEXz2dbWHbn6Hmyj9_-gVKD1lcpQ9ZXKU\"/><figcaption>7項企業看重的技能（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「經理人」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-07T08:23:53.634299+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":5689,"images":118,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}